WEBVTT
NOTE Cedwyn film, F003A, en. Timings estimated from the script v0.1.0; re-cut from the rendered audio.

1
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.508
[in Welsh] That's the last of it, Mam.
The quern's up, and the hens. We should

2
00:00:21.558 --> 00:00:24.550
be on the road before the sun clears the
wood.

3
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:32.350
Wait. I'll not leave a fire burning in
an empty house.

4
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:51.350
My mother's mother swept this floor. I
thought I'd be carried out of here, not

5
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.550
walk.

6
00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:02.350
The roof will stand a good while yet.
Someone will come up for the tiles and

7
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.415
the stone, I dare say.

8
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:20.350
Leave the door on the latch. If any of
ours come looking, let them find it

9
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:21.550
open.
